{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"C","type":"text","text":"# L1 动态图","x":-110,"y":-55,"width":220,"height":110,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"L0","type":"text","text":"## 语言表达","x":-500,"y":-50,"width":250,"height":100,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"LT","type":"text","text":"### 趋势表达","x":-900,"y":-250,"width":260,"height":95,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"R0","type":"text","text":"## Pre-writing","x":270,"y":-50,"width":250,"height":100,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"R1","type":"text","text":"### 题型判断","x":650,"y":-560,"width":260,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"R2","type":"text","text":"### 读题","x":650,"y":-250,"width":260,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"R3","type":"text","text":"### 分段","x":650,"y":120,"width":260,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"R11","type":"text","text":"**动态图**\n- 涉及两个以上时间点\n- 数据随时间变化\n- 大小比较 + 动态变化","x":1030,"y":-670,"width":380,"height":150},
		{"id":"R12","type":"text","text":"**静态图**\n- 大小比较","x":1030,"y":-470,"width":320,"height":100},
		{"id":"R21","type":"text","text":"**① 看标题**\n找对象（topic）","x":1030,"y":-310,"width":320,"height":110},
		{"id":"R22","type":"text","text":"**② 审纵轴**\n找单位（type of the figure）","x":1030,"y":-170,"width":360,"height":120},
		{"id":"R23","type":"text","text":"**③ 审横轴**\n定时态（tense）","x":1030,"y":-20,"width":320,"height":110},
		{"id":"R31","type":"text","text":"**文章架构**\n- Intro\n- Overview\n- Main features 1 / 2 / 3","x":1030,"y":190,"width":350,"height":150},
		{"id":"R32","type":"text","text":"**分段方式**\n- 按数值 level 分\n- 按趋势分\n- 按波动与否分\n- 按变化幅度分\n- 图像简单时按时间阶段划分","x":1030,"y":380,"width":400,"height":200},
		{"id":"R33","type":"text","text":"**注意事项**\n- 描述趋势最好提始末值\n- 检查是否包含过去与未来\n- 注意时态","x":1030,"y":620,"width":370,"height":150},
		{"id":"R41","type":"text","text":"**图线趋势**\n上升 / 下降 / 波动 / 平稳","x":1030,"y":860,"width":340,"height":110},
		{"id":"R42","type":"text","text":"**关键图像点**\n始值 / 终值 / 极值 / 赶超点 / 等值点 / 时间转折点","x":1030,"y":1010,"width":420,"height":130},
		{"id":"R231","type":"text","text":"**By 2000**\n过去完成时\nhad done","x":1450,"y":-150,"width":280,"height":120},
		{"id":"R232","type":"text","text":"**By 2020**\n将来完成时\nwill have done","x":1450,"y":0,"width":280,"height":120},
		{"id":"R233","type":"text","text":"**将来时书面化**\n- is expected to\n- is predicted to\n- is projected to\n- is estimated to","x":1450,"y":150,"width":330,"height":170},
		{"id":"LD","type":"text","text":"### 数据对象","x":-900,"y":-897,"width":260,"height":95,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"LD1","type":"text","text":"**基本表达**\n- the percentage\n- proportion\n- number of\n- amount of","x":-1320,"y":-1120,"width":330,"height":160},
		{"id":"LD2","type":"text","text":"**省略表达**\n- the data / figure for\n- emissions in\n- 保留核心词","x":-1320,"y":-922,"width":330,"height":145},
		{"id":"LD3","type":"text","text":"**代词替代**\n- the one / that\n- those / ones","x":-1320,"y":-760,"width":330,"height":120},
		{"id":"LD4","type":"text","text":"**例句**\nAverage carbon dioxide emissions per person in the UK overtook those in Sweden.","x":-1320,"y":-605,"width":390,"height":145},
		{"id":"LT3","type":"text","text":"**程度副词**\n大：sharply / dramatically / significantly / considerably / substantially...\n中：steadily / moderately / slightly / modestly...\n小或慢：gradually / continuously...","x":-1520,"y":0,"width":470,"height":205},
		{"id":"LT2","type":"text","text":"**下降**\n一般：decrease / drop / fall / decline / go down\n急剧：plummet / plunge / tumble\n缓慢：dwindle","x":-1505,"y":-200,"width":440,"height":185},
		{"id":"LT1","type":"text","text":"**上升**\n一般：rise / increase / climb / go up\n急剧：surge / soar / rocket\nrise → rose → risen","x":-1495,"y":-415,"width":420,"height":165},
		{"id":"LT6","type":"text","text":"**词性搭配**\n- a/an + adj. + n.\n- V. + adv.","x":-1395,"y":220,"width":330,"height":120},
		{"id":"LT5","type":"text","text":"**平稳**\n- remain / stay / keep + stable\n- remain / stay / keep + constant\n- stabilise / level off / plateau\n- 具体数据用 at","x":-1585,"y":378,"width":430,"height":180},
		{"id":"LT4","type":"text","text":"**波动**\n- fluctuate / experience fluctuations\n- hover + 数据\n- fluctuate between 最小值 and 最大值\n- fluctuate around 平均值","x":-1540,"y":570,"width":440,"height":185},
		{"id":"LS1","type":"text","text":"**最值**\n- peak at + 数据\n- bottom out at + 数据","x":-1490,"y":835,"width":330,"height":120},
		{"id":"LS2","type":"text","text":"**超越点**\n- overtake → overtook\n- outnumber\n- surpass\n- exceed","x":-1490,"y":985,"width":330,"height":145},
		{"id":"LS3","type":"text","text":"**等值点**\n- be at the same level / value as\n- be at an identical level to\n- at + 数值","x":-1490,"y":1160,"width":390,"height":150},
		{"id":"LS","type":"text","text":"### 特殊点","x":-880,"y":800,"width":260,"height":95,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"LC","type":"text","text":"### 句型与连接","x":-200,"y":1035,"width":260,"height":95,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"LC1","type":"text","text":"**升降句型**\n- 数据对象 + experienced/presented + a 形名\n- 数据对象 + 动副结构\n- There be + a 形名 + in + 数据对象\n- a 形名 + could be found in + 数据对象\n- 时间段/地区 + witnessed/saw + a 形名 + in + 数据对象","x":-960,"y":1007,"width":500,"height":245},
		{"id":"LC2","type":"text","text":"**数值连接**\n- from：从……\n- to：到……\n- by：差值（变化词为动词）\n- of：差值（变化词为名词）","x":-960,"y":1287,"width":420,"height":180},
		{"id":"LC3","type":"text","text":"**多阶段连接**\n- after / before\n- followed by / but\n- SVO, but then VO\n- SVO, before doing\n- SVO, after which SVO\n- SVO, followed by + 阶段","x":-960,"y":1497,"width":440,"height":215},
		{"id":"LC4","type":"text","text":"**注意**\n- 数据后加单位\n- 或注明数据产生的年份\n- SVO = 主语 + 谓语 + 宾语","x":-960,"y":1747,"width":380,"height":145},
		{"id":"R4","type":"text","text":"### 要点","x":650,"y":920,"width":260,"height":100,"color":"5"}
	],
